  "fullDescription": "✨ Spooky Christmas Coloring Pages for Adults – 60 Unique Designs | PNG, JPEG & PDF ✨\n\nBring a haunting twist to your holiday season with this Spooky Christmas Coloring Pages for Adults collection! This unique bundle blends creepy charm with festive cheer, featuring 60 beautifully detailed spooky Christmas illustrations. Perfect for artists who love gothic, horror, witchy, or dark–aesthetic holiday themes, each page offers relaxing and creative escape during the Christmas season.\n\nInside this set, you’ll find eerie Santa characters, haunted Christmas trees, creepy ornaments, ghostly snowmen, skull-filled stockings, dark winter scenes, and much more. All designs are high-resolution (300 DPI) and delivered in PNG, JPEG & PDF formats, making them perfect for printing, crafting, journaling, DIY projects, and coloring book creators.\n\nGive your holiday coloring a spooky makeover and enjoy hours of creativity!\n\n🖤 What’s Included\n\n✔️ 60 Unique Spooky Christmas Coloring Pages\n\n✔️ PNG Files (300 DPI)\n\n✔️ JPEG Files (300 DPI)\n\n✔️ Print-Ready PDF File\n\n✔️ High-Resolution Black & White Line Art\n\n✔️ Perfect for Printing, Digital Coloring, or KDP Interiors\n\n✔️ Size: 8.5×8.5″ inches (Letter size)\n\n✔️ Instant Digital Download\n\n🎄 Perfect For\n\nAdult coloring enthusiasts\n\nSpooky & gothic art lovers\n\nChristmas craft projects\n\nDIY printable gifts\n\nScrapbooking & journaling\n\nKDP coloring book creators\n\nHoliday relaxation and stress relief\n\n📌 Note\n\nThis is a digital download only, no physical item will be shipped.\nFiles are suitable for personal use and commercial use (as allowed by Creative Fabrica).",
